== Notes ==
* This spell only removes the mind-affecting effects that clarity removes ([[dazed]], [[sleep]], [[confused]], [[stunned]], and [[charmed]]) plus [[dominated]] and the negative effects of the spells [[bane]] and [[feeblemind]].  It does not remove [[paralysis]] or [[frightened|fear]].
* Due to a .2da bug, ''confusion'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.

